<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>An Example of Prompt Construction for Few-shot learning. <math id="S3.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{S}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{S}</annotation></semantics></math> represent “Zero-shot” and “Few-shot”, respectively.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
