<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Performance of LLMs and SLMs under <span id="S5.T5.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">instruction tuning (LoRA)</span> setting across eight healthcare monitoring tasks. <span id="S5.T5.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">STRS</span>: Stress, <span id="S5.T5.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">READ</span>: Readiness, <span id="S5.T5.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FATG</span>: Fatigue, <span id="S5.T5.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SQ</span>: Sleep Quality, <span id="S5.T5.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ANX</span>: Anxiety, <span id="S5.T5.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DEP</span>: Depression, <span id="S5.T5.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ACT</span>: Activity, <span id="S5.T5.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CAL</span>: Calories. Best result is in <span id="S5.T5.22" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, second-best result is <span id="S5.T5.23" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. ‘-’ denotes model failed to produce valid prediction.</figcaption>
